    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-aaef752c-fc6f-4d18-80b5-26d5e1d18e11",
      "chapter_id": "ch-c3fa2162-fd91-491e-9a02-211eb7c7fe98",
      "chapter_number": 7,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "航图被固定在雾线水门外的锚柱上，右下角缺失了一块。",
      "sha256": "1e159e7c5a5225268aab364e95e0926700e43c30781b7eaa0fcd4237e9f1f38d"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-3c5e10d5-6648-48cf-9345-df192f000a27",
      "chapter_id": "ch-f30bb2a4-1a4a-431b-99d6-dabca5e1eee5",
      "chapter_number": 6,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "电台在二十一点零五分收到三次短促求救码，信号来自雾线水门以外。",
      "sha256": "2d354cc208c312f81f0d4d72c682603571b1edd1bfaf6bcf3561e4e04a22dc6a"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-6414d0c7-6fc8-4fc2-8591-88107d978653",
      "chapter_id": "ch-4019854e-1a33-4eb0-a7b9-1221dc3a7af9",
      "chapter_number": 10,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "北潮闸并未关闭，雾钟却响了一次；温岚仍握着罗盘，港外传来白色渡船的汽笛。",
      "sha256": "183759380df3c5c073ba0256d25ae7426cb03fc193282a5f791b26586f45103b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-ed69ce8a-1a83-4fb8-987b-3bbfbea8e15f",
      "chapter_id": "ch-c9637c70-0f85-4afb-8174-5d42aa61867f",
      "chapter_number": 9,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "进入仓道前，苏岑把带月牙裂纹的黄铜罗盘交到温岚手里保管。",
      "sha256": "c118f3d296dfb8d143c3b0b5467637a24e73f833356f845d5d5c7596956d88a5"
    },
